{"canonical_version": "canonical/1.0", "kind": "note", "identity_layer": "upstream_id", "upstream_id": "872015292", "account": {"user_id": "82160871", "username": "mewcatcher"}, "url": "https://www.douban.com/note/872015292/", "revisions": [{"parser_version": "doubak-data-parser/0.8.0", "first_observed_at": "2026-08-06T23:16:45+10:00", "last_observed_at": "2026-08-12T21:21:48+10:00", "fields": {"title": "豆瓣更换海外手机号显示“不可预期状态”的解决方案", "published_at": {"raw": "2025-04-14 18:47:50", "iso": "2025-04-14T18:47:50+08:00", "precision": "second", "timezone_assumption": "Asia/Shanghai"}, "body": "今天发现豆瓣终于可以绑定海外手机号了，这样可以省去一大堆麻烦事。因为我国内的手机号并不会一直带在身边。\n\n那么这个问题怎么解决呢，通过开发者工具看一下这个网络验证请求的payload数据其实是错误的 (URL: https://accounts.douban.com/j/mobile/rebind/complete)：\n\n- ck=JBf5\n- old_phone=+86xxxxxxxxxxx\n- area_code=+86 (这里错了，对我来说这个数字应该是61)\n- number=xxxxxxxxxx\n- code=xxxx\n\n所以解决方法很简答，在开发者工具里面把这个request的cURL拷贝下来，然后把area_code变成你的新手机号的区号，然后运行那个cURL直接就可以了。", "rating": null, "subject_url": null, "location": "澳大利亚"}, "digests": {"title": "sha256:065d6e2368b1134882fa785b6f8542490ee6af3a7e7b8aa45c1a465240af0b8e", "published_at": "sha256:f7d5713a803a450e6a82f1dede4a17090ea4b7309c821883395f0cadd97c4606", "body": "sha256:a50e7d0f7e7607138a7517e06765ea818266e4deaa0070c81cfea45ecc6da91f", "rating": null, "subject_url": null, "location": "sha256:0b1001a02c971a01ebc585b5cb04897b35e4cb4b8cb6f91bddd2b5c622064441"}, "observations": [{"bundle_id": "20260806T131620Z-354a1d", "capture_ids": ["20260806T131620Z-354a1d#000012"], "observed_at": "2026-08-06T23:16:45+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T050438Z-9f5719", "capture_ids": ["20260807T050438Z-9f5719#000010"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T15:04:59+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T062518Z-c34601", "capture_ids": ["20260807T062518Z-c34601#000010"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T16:25:36+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T082714Z-ba57a3", "capture_ids": ["20260807T082714Z-ba57a3#000010"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T18:27:36+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T083529Z-0fb09c", "capture_ids": ["20260807T083529Z-0fb09c#000011"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T18:35:53+10:00", "absence_authority": "none", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260809T220553Z-157e63", "capture_ids": ["20260809T220553Z-157e63#000011"], "observed_at": "2026-08-10T08:06:11+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260812T112125Z-73f85f", "capture_ids": ["20260812T112125Z-73f85f#000011"], "observed_at": "2026-08-12T21:21:48+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}]}]}
