{"canonical_version": "canonical/1.0", "kind": "review", "identity_layer": "upstream_id", "upstream_id": "8381069", "account": {"user_id": "82160871", "username": "mewcatcher"}, "url": "https://www.douban.com/review/8381069/", "revisions": [{"parser_version": "doubak-data-parser/0.8.0", "first_observed_at": "2026-08-06T23:16:47+10:00", "last_observed_at": "2026-08-12T21:21:51+10:00", "fields": {"title": "一个区域的很多地点都一模一样啊，是偷工减料了吗", "published_at": {"raw": "2017-02-24 16:15:24", "iso": "2017-02-24T16:15:24+08:00", "precision": "second", "timezone_assumption": "Asia/Shanghai"}, "body": "玩了Open Beta大概10个小时，起始那片区域很多很多地方都一样的布局，连人的位置都没有变化，很明显的感觉到至少有2个地方我打了3遍，但是地理位置绝对不一样 _(:з」∠)_\n\n然后联合军队的无限增援有点太BUG了吧hhh\n\n我发现不标记就狙，不计入最大射程，我之前标记了，然后跑很远射了个505m，然后我没标记射了个550m的样子发现个人资料里面并没有更新（确认狙死）。\n\n（豆瓣游戏条目里面没有提问题的地方，所以就写到这了）", "rating": 4, "subject_url": "https://www.douban.com/game/26425271/", "location": null}, "digests": {"title": "sha256:75a07f65133a77638f1a881c8f6ba7d36d35f06f5751c980c231ea35a9f7a53b", "published_at": "sha256:9a397bb9f2e5d9f39e379d09c20ea1de7d05a2d166a3fa8681ae4ab479011549", "body": "sha256:bc76eec4c28c491f54f26713dfc899b152e4ddb4554140c589fa8fdec6c8dcf4", "rating": "sha256:4b227777d4dd1fc61c6f884f48641d02b4d121d3fd328cb08b5531fcacdabf8a", "subject_url": "sha256:43c775cfc689325e506aa6641f693b94215774c75d686bbf03d7e919656bad0a", "location": null}, "observations": [{"bundle_id": "20260806T131620Z-354a1d", "capture_ids": ["20260806T131620Z-354a1d#000014"], "observed_at": "2026-08-06T23:16:47+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T050438Z-9f5719", "capture_ids": ["20260807T050438Z-9f5719#000012"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T15:05:02+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T062518Z-c34601", "capture_ids": ["20260807T062518Z-c34601#000012"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T16:25:40+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T082714Z-ba57a3", "capture_ids": ["20260807T082714Z-ba57a3#000012"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T18:27:39+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T083529Z-0fb09c", "capture_ids": ["20260807T083529Z-0fb09c#000013"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T18:35:57+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260809T220553Z-157e63", "capture_ids": ["20260809T220553Z-157e63#000013"], "observed_at": "2026-08-10T08:06:15+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260812T112125Z-73f85f", "capture_ids": ["20260812T112125Z-73f85f#000013"], "observed_at": "2026-08-12T21:21:51+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}]}]}
{"canonical_version": "canonical/1.0", "kind": "review", "identity_layer": "upstream_id", "upstream_id": "7500205", "account": {"user_id": "82160871", "username": "mewcatcher"}, "url": "https://www.douban.com/review/7500205/", "revisions": [{"parser_version": "doubak-data-parser/0.8.0", "first_observed_at": "2026-08-06T23:16:50+10:00", "last_observed_at": "2026-08-12T21:21:54+10:00", "fields": {"title": "噗，搬运一下组里用来做测试的攻略吧 - CROSS†CHANNEL汉化版攻略", "published_at": {"raw": "2015-06-14 21:57:18", "iso": "2015-06-14T21:57:18+08:00", "precision": "second", "timezone_assumption": "Asia/Shanghai"}, "body": "欢迎&感谢大家帮忙推广这部作品的汉化版啦——\n谨代表全组成员 敬上\n\nCROSS†CHANNEL汉化项目主页：www.crosschannel.cn\n\n------------------------------\n\n*可能与游戏中的选项翻译不太一样\n\nCROSS † CHANNEL\n\n　去天台\n\n　让她赎罪\n\n　袭胸\n\n　帮忙\n\n　去参加社团活动\n\n　不去\n\n　犯傻\n\n崩壊／純化\n\n　　　見里\n　去天台\n\n　看内裤\n\n　掀裙子\n\n　去天台\n\n　帮忙\n\n　去参加社团活动\n\n　帮忙医治\n\n　逼迫\t\n\n　继续逼迫\n\n　逼迫\n\nCROSS POINT\n　　　需要3周。\n　　　CROSS POINT 中可以攻略雾。\n　　　崩壊／純化 中未攻略的人物也在此攻略。\n　　　（这时，进入見里 or 冬子 剧情时，副标题会变为 崩壊／純化。）\n　　　見里 ・ 冬子 ・ 霧 攻略后，便可攻略美希。\n\n　　　冬子\n　一个人吃\n\n　去学校\n\n　与冬子说话\n\n　看内裤\n\n　掀裙子\n\n　去教室\n\n　搭话\n\n　搭话\n\n　邀请樱庭\n\n　　　霧\n　去神龛 → 見里・冬子 攻略后（含崩壊／純化 ）追加\n\n　一年级教室\n\n　搭话\n\n　性骚扰&签名\n\n　给三明治\n\n　去二年级教室看看\n\n　去一年级教室看看\n\n　给她吃\n\n　追雾\n\n　不接受\n\n　　　美希\n　去田崎商店 → 見里・冬子・霧 攻略后（含崩壊／純化 ）追加\n\n　去社团活动室\n\n　去一年级教室看看\n\n　　　美希剧情结尾，副标题变为 『 INVISIBLE MURDER INVISIBLE TEARS 』 。\n\n唯一之物\n　需要两周。\n　攻略雾之后，才可攻略美希。\n\n　　　霧\n　走廊\n\n　走廊\n\n  投降\n  \n　美希\n\n　天台\n\n　忍耐 → 「顶撞」にCG有 \n\n　　　选择「顶撞」后会需要重新走一边雾线，但是在开头部分会增加三笨蛋的回忆\n\n　　　美希\n　一年级教室\n\n　搭话\n\n　去田崎商店 → 霧 攻略後追加\n\n　邀请约会\n\n　天台\n\n　食堂\n\n　　　下周开始是送还。无攻略顺序。只有美希必须在雾之后。\n\n重要的人（霧）\n　一年级教室\n\n　搭话\n\n去道歉（見里・友貴）\n　去学校 → 霧 结束後追加\n\n　屋上\n\nDisintegration（冬子）\n　去学校 → 霧 结束後追加\n\n　二年级教室\n\n親友（桜庭）\n　去学校 → 霧 结束後追加\n\n　食堂\n\n有朝一日，我……（美希）\n　去田崎商店 → 霧 结束後追加\n\n　邀请约会\n\n　　　之后无选项。\n\n胆小鬼（曜子）\n\nCROSS × CHANNEL\n\n黑须 † 晚安\n\nEND", "rating": 5, "subject_url": "https://www.douban.com/game/10758368/", "location": null}, "digests": {"title": "sha256:e7b36a29d11a53d36b58bc3efc3a40f0a0a3340528ba32db2dc7b852235ef5e7", "published_at": "sha256:96d4b8d709efe3cb39845e0f372516f7597c9332901a8f1a17b753861254d5c0", "body": "sha256:156e19c9122df4f28a445bb0c58f6761b1568b128ab516e395d8cfce323e6814", "rating": "sha256:ef2d127de37b942baad06145e54b0c619a1f22327b2ebbcfbec78f5564afe39d", "subject_url": "sha256:d6f5963452c12bf038fbd6fad2e5de5577b97122e95d1015f4fe198b443d9202", "location": null}, "observations": [{"bundle_id": "20260806T131620Z-354a1d", "capture_ids": ["20260806T131620Z-354a1d#000015"], "observed_at": "2026-08-06T23:16:50+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T050438Z-9f5719", "capture_ids": ["20260807T050438Z-9f5719#000013"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T15:05:03+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T062518Z-c34601", "capture_ids": ["20260807T062518Z-c34601#000013"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T16:25:41+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T082714Z-ba57a3", "capture_ids": ["20260807T082714Z-ba57a3#000013"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T18:27:41+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260807T083529Z-0fb09c", "capture_ids": ["20260807T083529Z-0fb09c#000014"], "observed_at": "2026-08-07T18:35:58+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260809T220553Z-157e63", "capture_ids": ["20260809T220553Z-157e63#000014"], "observed_at": "2026-08-10T08:06:16+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}, {"bundle_id": "20260812T112125Z-73f85f", "capture_ids": ["20260812T112125Z-73f85f#000014"], "observed_at": "2026-08-12T21:21:54+10:00", "absence_authority": "whole_route", "surface": "html"}]}]}
